        "WILL YOU ENTER OR CONTINUE YOUR JOURNEY"
      ],
      "message_id": "zhentil.edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "zhentil.guards_question",
      "all_contains": [
        "STOP!  GET OVER HERE",
        "GUARDS TAKE YOU ASIDE FOR QUESTIONING",
